SCOPE: This MIT license covers the SOURCE CODE of Commander In Chief (GDScript
under src/, tools/, tests/, and project configuration). It does NOT grant any
rights to the bundled art, audio, or other assets, which carry their own
separate terms. See ASSETS.md for a complete per-directory provenance and
licensing map.

Every IMAGE in this repository is either owned by the project (procedurally
generated by tools/gen_*.py, or generative-AI art commissioned by the project)
or CC0 (assets/cc0/, assets/fonts/), each of which ships its own CC0 notice.

The bundled AUDIO under assets/vo/ and assets/audio/ is synthesized speech
generated for this project. It is documented in ASSETS.md rather than granted by
this file.

NOTE ON assets/vo/: those lines imitate the voice of an identifiable public
figure. The project owns the recordings, but right of publicity belongs to the
person and is not the project's to grant. They are published as satire. If you
redistribute or reuse this repository, that question travels with the audio --
see ASSETS.md.

Art from third-party packs was bundled in earlier revisions. All of it was
replaced with owned or CC0 work, and removed from the working tree AND from git
history on 2026-07-27. Clones made before that date are on rewritten history and
must be re-cloned.
